{"chunk_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_long_term_care_definition_001","chunk_file_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_chunkset_v003","chunk_index":1,"parent_chunk_id":null,"source_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc","section":"什麼是長期照顧服務","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"source_locator":"官方網頁主內容 > 什麼是長期照顧服務（網頁行11-17）","text":"長期照顧服務是指針對預期或已達六個月以上無法生活自理的民眾，由長照服務人員及單位，提供各種照顧及專業服務（包含居家服務、日間照顧、家庭托顧、小規模多機能服務、專業服務）、輔具租借、購買及居家無障礙環境改善、交通接送及喘息服務等。\n長期照顧服務對於被照顧者本人或是家屬而言，都可能承受極大的經濟與心理壓力。若您打算在家親自照顧家人，或是聘僱外籍看護工，都可以使用「長照服務」，經評估符合資格者，有政府提供的長照服務資源與補助，減輕長照的負擔！","embedding_text":"申請長照服務｜什麼是長期照顧服務｜長期照顧服務、長照服務、六個月以上、照顧及專業服務、政府補助、長照、LTC｜長期照顧服務是指針對預期或已達六個月以上無法生活自理的民眾，由長照服務人員及單位，提供各種照顧及專業服務（包含居家服務、日間照顧、家庭托顧、小規模多機能服務、專業服務）、輔具租借、購買及居家無障礙環境改善、交通接送及喘息服務等。\n長期照顧服務對於被照顧者本人或是家屬而言，都可能承受極大的經濟與心理壓力。若您打算在家親自照顧家人，或是聘僱外籍看護工，都可以使用「長照服務」，經評估符合資格者，有政府提供的長照服務資源與補助，減輕長照的負擔！","metadata":{"source_file":"申請長照服務_官方頁面文字快照_20260727.txt","document_title":"申請長照服務","source_type":"service_guide","publish_agency":"mohw","authority_level":"official_government","chunk_type":"definition","primary_category":"service_categories","service_category":"other","service_item":null,"user_intent":"ask_service_definition","process_stage":"before_application","persona_restriction":"general","contact_channel":null,"answer_scope":["application_process","service_information","contact_information","official_resource_navigation"],"prohibited_usage":["eligibility_determination","care_level_determination","benefit_calculation","automatic_service_approval"],"risk_level":"low","requires_official_assessment":false,"requires_human_review":false,"stop_normal_rag":false,"review_status":"needs_review","confidence_level":"medium","current_status":"current","official_source_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6533-70777-207.html","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MjM-agXNFaDdroOpQbgE0UlN_sCPU36D/view?usp=drivesdk","source_version":"unknown","last_verified_at":"2026-07-27","language":"zh-TW","locale":"zh-TW","keywords":["長期照顧服務","長照服務","六個月以上","照顧及專業服務","政府補助"],"aliases":["長照","LTC"],"entities":["衛生福利部","長照服務人員"],"title_path":["申請長照服務","什麼是長期照顧服務"],"char_count":220,"token_count":null,"chunk_content_hash":"284a2603a675009a998a3beaaeacb47329899a53e748d25101968c329ca29bf0","parser_version":"official_page_text_snapshot_v2","chunker_version":"semantic_heading_chunker_v2","embedding_model_id":"cohere.embed-v4:0","embedding_model_version":"v4.0","vector_dimension":1024,"embedding_status":"not_started","index_name":"ltc-public-knowledge-staging-v1","index_document_id":null,"indexed_at":null,"allowed_audiences":["elder","family_caregiver","caregiver"],"allowed_purposes":["general_information"],"share_scope":"public_knowledge","data_classification":"public","license_status":"open"}}
