{"chunk_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_benefit_amount_table_012","chunk_file_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_chunkset_v003","chunk_index":12,"parent_chunk_id":null,"source_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc","section":"長照服務給付額度表","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"source_locator":"官方網頁主內容 > 長照服務給付額度表（網頁行86-102；表格正規化）","text":"【表格正規化】長照服務給付額度如下：照顧及專業服務月額，第2級10,020元、第3級15,460元、第4級18,580元、第5級24,100元、第6級28,070元、第7級32,090元、第8級36,180元。交通接送月額依居住地縣市鄉鎮分區，第一區1,680元、第二區1,840元、第三區2,000元、第四區2,400元。輔具服務與居家無障礙改善三年額度，第一組40,000元、第二組60,000元（自115年7月1日起實施）。喘息服務年額，第2至6級32,340元、第7至8級48,510元。","embedding_text":"申請長照服務｜長照服務給付額度表｜給付額度、長照等級、照顧及專業服務、交通接送、輔具、居家無障礙、喘息服務、長照額度表、補助額度｜【表格正規化】長照服務給付額度如下：照顧及專業服務月額，第2級10,020元、第3級15,460元、第4級18,580元、第5級24,100元、第6級28,070元、第7級32,090元、第8級36,180元。交通接送月額依居住地縣市鄉鎮分區，第一區1,680元、第二區1,840元、第三區2,000元、第四區2,400元。輔具服務與居家無障礙改善三年額度，第一組40,000元、第二組60,000元（自115年7月1日起實施）。喘息服務年額，第2至6級32,340元、第7至8級48,510元。","metadata":{"source_file":"申請長照服務_官方頁面文字快照_20260727.txt","document_title":"申請長照服務","source_type":"service_guide","publish_agency":"mohw","authority_level":"official_government","chunk_type":"table","primary_category":"eligibility_assessment","service_category":"other","service_item":null,"user_intent":"ask_application_assessment","process_stage":"home_assessment","persona_restriction":"general","contact_channel":"local_care_management_center","answer_scope":["application_process","service_information","contact_information","official_resource_navigation"],"prohibited_usage":["eligibility_determination","care_level_determination","benefit_calculation","automatic_service_approval"],"risk_level":"medium","requires_official_assessment":true,"requires_human_review":false,"stop_normal_rag":false,"review_status":"needs_review","confidence_level":"medium","current_status":"current","official_source_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6533-70777-207.html","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MjM-agXNFaDdroOpQbgE0UlN_sCPU36D/view?usp=drivesdk","source_version":"unknown","last_verified_at":"2026-07-