{"chunk_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_foreign_caregiver_faq_014","chunk_file_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_chunkset_v003","chunk_index":14,"parent_chunk_id":null,"source_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc","section":"常見問答／家裡有申請外籍看護工可以申請長照嗎","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"source_locator":"官方網頁主內容 > 常見問答 > 外籍看護工（網頁行108-114）","text":"家裡有申請外籍看護工可以申請長照嗎？\n可以！上述的服務可申請照顧及專業服務（使用除居家服務以外之照顧組合，且額度為照顧及專業服務額度的30%）、交通接送、輔具與無障礙環境評估，還有當外籍看護工請假休息時也可以申請喘息服務。","embedding_text":"申請長照服務｜常見問答／家裡有申請外籍看護工可以申請長照嗎｜外籍看護工、外籍家庭看護工、30%、交通接送、輔具、喘息服務、外看家庭、聘僱外看｜家裡有申請外籍看護工可以申請長照嗎？\n可以！上述的服務可申請照顧及專業服務（使用除居家服務以外之照顧組合，且額度為照顧及專業服務額度的30%）、交通接送、輔具與無障礙環境評估，還有當外籍看護工請假休息時也可以申請喘息服務。","metadata":{"source_file":"申請長照服務_官方頁面文字快照_20260727.txt","document_title":"申請長照服務","source_type":"service_guide","publish_agency":"mohw","authority_level":"official_government","chunk_type":"faq","primary_category":"caregiver_support","service_category":"other","service_item":null,"user_intent":"ask_application_assessment","process_stage":"before_application","persona_restriction":"family_caregiver","contact_channel":"1966","answer_scope":["application_process","service_information","contact_information","official_resource_navigation"],"prohibited_usage":["eligibility_determination","care_level_determination","benefit_calculation","automatic_service_approval"],"risk_level":"medium","requires_official_assessment":true,"requires_human_review":false,"stop_normal_rag":false,"review_status":"needs_review","confidence_level":"medium","current_status":"current","official_source_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6533-70777-207.html","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MjM-agXNFaDdroOpQbgE0UlN_sCPU36D/view?usp=drivesdk","source_version":"unknown","last_verified_at":"2026-07-27","language":"zh-TW","locale":"zh-TW","keywords":["外籍看護工","外籍家庭看護工","30%","交通接送","輔具","喘息服務"],"aliases":["外看家庭","聘僱外看"],"entities":["外籍看護工","長照專線1966"],"title_path":["申請長照服務","常見問答／家裡有申請外籍看護工可以申請長照嗎"],"char_count":111,"token_count":null,"chunk_content_hash":"d7bdca3bc2db