{"chunk_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_community_resources_if_not_eligible_015","chunk_file_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_chunkset_v003","chunk_index":15,"parent_chunk_id":null,"source_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc","section":"常見問答／評估結果還沒有符合長照服務資格怎麼辦","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"source_locator":"官方網頁主內容 > 常見問答 > 未符合長照資格（網頁行116-122）","text":"評估結果還沒有符合長照服務資格怎麼辦？\n若評估結果沒有符合長照給付服務資格，除了長照服務外，現在政府補助設置許多長照的社區服務據點（包括社區照顧關懷據點、巷弄長照站、文化健康站等），提供長輩健康促進、共餐、預防及延緩失能／失智服務方案，鼓勵社區長輩就近參與據點活動，預防或延緩失能／失智，詳細可洽當地縣市政府長期照顧管理中心。","embedding_text":"申請長照服務｜常見問答／評估結果還沒有符合長照服務資格怎麼辦｜未符合長照資格、社區照顧關懷據點、巷弄長照站、文化健康站、共餐、預防及延緩失能、社區長照據點、長照地圖｜評估結果還沒有符合長照服務資格怎麼辦？\n若評估結果沒有符合長照給付服務資格，除了長照服務外，現在政府補助設置許多長照的社區服務據點（包括社區照顧關懷據點、巷弄長照站、文化健康站等），提供長輩健康促進、共餐、預防及延緩失能／失智服務方案，鼓勵社區長輩就近參與據點活動，預防或延緩失能／失智，詳細可洽當地縣市政府長期照顧管理中心。","metadata":{"source_file":"申請長照服務_官方頁面文字快照_20260727.txt","document_title":"申請長照服務","source_type":"service_guide","publish_agency":"mohw","authority_level":"official_government","chunk_type":"resource","primary_category":"community_care_service","service_category":"community_based","service_item":"community_support_resource","user_intent":"ask_resource_planning","process_stage":"before_application","persona_restriction":"general","contact_channel":["local_care_management_center","ltc_geo_map"],"answer_scope":["application_process","service_information","contact_information","official_resource_navigation"],"prohibited_usage":["eligibility_determination","care_level_determination","benefit_calculation","automatic_service_approval"],"risk_level":"low","requires_official_assessment":false,"requires_human_review":false,"stop_normal_rag":false,"review_status":"needs_review","confidence_level":"medium","current_status":"current","official_source_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6533-70777-207.html","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MjM-agXNFaDdroOpQbgE0UlN_sCPU36D/view?usp=drivesdk","source_version":"unknown","last_verified_at":"2026-07-27","language":"zh-TW","locale":"zh-TW","keywords":["未符合長照資格","社區照顧關懷據點","巷弄長照站","文化健康站","共餐","預防及延緩失能"],"aliases":["社區長照據點","長照地圖"],"entities":["長期照顧管理中心","社區照顧關懷據點","巷弄長照站","文化健康站"],"title_path":["申請長照服務","常見問答／評估結果還沒有符合長照服務資格怎麼辦"],"char_count":163,"token_count":null,"chunk_content_hash":"2b42419be3e7db8bdd39c870dee1fc989a6c15c72b9cd06dd137b14716ae19ff","parser_version":"official_page_text_snapshot_v2","chunker_version":"semantic_heading_chunker_v2","embedding_model_id":"cohere.embed-v4:0","embedding_model_version":"v4.0","vector_dimension":1024,"embedding_status":"not_started","index_name":"ltc-public-knowledge-staging-v1","index_document_id":null,"indexed_at":null,"allowed_audiences":["elder","family_caregiver","caregiver"],"allowed_purposes":["general_information","resource_navigation"],"share_scope":"public_knowledge","data_classification":"public","license_status":"open"}}
{"chunk_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_dementia_resources_faq_016","chunk_file_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc_chunkset_v003","chunk_index":16,"parent_chunk_id":null,"source_id":"mohw_1966_apply_ltc","section":"常見問答／家人是失智還有別的資源可以利用嗎","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"source_locator":"官方網頁主內容 > 常見問答 > 失智照護資源（網頁行124-130）","text":"家人是失智還有別的資源可以利用嗎？\n失智照顧確實不容易，除了上述的長照資源外，另外還有團體家屋、失智共同照顧中心、失智社區服務據點等失智照顧服務資源。","embedding_text":"申請長照服務｜常見問答／家人是失智還有別的資源可以利用嗎｜失智照顧、團體家屋、失智共同照顧中心、失智社區服務據點、失智資源、失智據點｜家人是失智還有別的資源可以利用嗎？\n失智照顧確實不容易，除了上述的長照資源外，另外還有團體家屋、失智共同照顧中心、失智社區服務據點等失智照顧服務資源。","metadata":{"source_file":"申請長照服務_官方頁面文字快照_20260727.txt","document_title":"申請長照服務","source_type":"service_guide","publish_agency":"mohw","authority_level":"official_government","chunk_type":"resource","primary_category":"community_care_service","service_category":"community_based","service_item":"dementia_care_resource","user_intent":"ask_resource_planning","process_stage":"before_application","persona_restriction":"family_caregiver","contact_channel":"official_dementia_resources","answer_scope":["application_process","service_information","contact_information","official_resource_navigation"],"prohibited_usage":["eligibility_determination","care_level_determination","benefit_calculation","automatic_service_approval"],"risk_level":"low","requires_official_assessment":false,"requires_human_review":false,"stop_normal_rag":false,"review_status":"needs_review","confidence_level":"medium","current_status":"current","official_source_url":"https://1966.gov.tw/LTC/cp-6533-70777-207.html","storage_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MjM-agXNFaDdroOpQbgE0UlN_sCPU36D/view?usp=drivesdk","source_version":"unknown","last_verified_at":"2026-07-27","language":"zh-TW","locale":"zh-TW","keywords":["失智照顧","團體家屋","失智共同照顧中心","失智社區服務據點"],"aliases":["失智資源","失智據點"],"entities":["團體家屋","失智共同照顧中心","失智社區服務據點"],"title_path":["申請長照服務","常見問答／家人是失智還有別的資源可以利用嗎"],"char_count":75,"token_count":null,"chunk_content_hash":"76f892e39881fee1536c5af990b020